10. What is a Custom Collector?

Answer:

Custom Collector allows creating your own collection logic.

Example:

Collector<Employee,
          List<String>,
          List<String>>

Use Cases:

✓ Custom Statistics
✓ Custom Report Generation
✓ Special Aggregations
✓ Complex Business Rules

Interview One-Liner:

Use Custom Collector when built-in Collectors
cannot satisfy business requirements.

